/** Public reference ledger. Building photographs are inspected, not redistributed as textures.
 * The separately licensed illustrative sky asset is documented below and in ASSETS.md.
 * Coordinates below are interpreted from public wayfinding diagrams, not a survey.
 * Keep uncertainties explicit; do not invent room numbers or claim measured accuracy.
 * Historical focused verification 2026-10-03: 25 geometry/navigation checks passed, covering
 * auditorium aisles and standing clearance, all modeled room shortcut arrivals,
 * Level 5 support-room access and furnished-detail culling. Browser checks cover
 * Enter building, cancellable startup, references, the lobby and Antonov view.
 * This is a partial review; it does not verify every floor or close the gaps below.
 * Continuation verification: 110 geometry/navigation cases and 26 walking/input
 * cases passed. Browser controls were used to walk both west flights from G
 * into the Level 1 corridor; west shortcuts on Levels 1–5 were inspected.
 * Pointer ownership is covered by simulated events, not a physical touch test.
 * Antonov seating continuation: 13 focused checks passed for traced bank counts,
 * fan angle, tier support, chair/desk separation and longitudinal/cross-aisles.
 * Native-frame continuation 2026-10-04: 39 coupled auditorium/Gannon/garden
 * cases passed after replacing the fitted enclosure and shifted seating with
 * original upper-plan room faces, 298 student chairs plus one presenter, 31
 * actual desk edges and 47 outdoor cross-sections in one shared source frame.
 * Raw paths stay outside the browser bundle. Metric scale, section and current
 * furniture configuration remain unverified; the foyer is incomplete.
 * Outdoor-stair continuation: the author-published exterior photos identify
 * open flights beside the roof collar. Treads share rendered/walking support.
 * The new elevations remain provisional; foyer and upper access are incomplete.
 */
// Examined but not used to assign upper-floor rooms:
// - UMIACS /images/2/2e/Inperson_IRB.png is a 517×266 full-floor diagram,
